---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us - Old Towns Walks" description="Learn more about Old Towns Walks, our mission, and high-quality 4K walking tour video production.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 text-gray-200">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-yellow-500 mb-6">About Old Towns Walks</h1>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-300">
      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>Old Towns Walks</strong>, your ultimate destination for immersive, high-definition 4K walking tours around the world. Our mission is to bring the authentic atmosphere, historical streets, vibrant local culture, and scenic routes directly to your screen.
      </p>

      <p>
        Whether you are looking to explore historic European old towns, tranquil coastal paths, bustling street food markets, or relaxing rain walks, our point-of-view (POV) walking videos offer a natural and relaxing travel experience.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Our Production Quality</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-300">
        <li><strong>Ultra HD 4K 60FPS:</strong> Crystal clear video footage recorded in native 4K resolution.</li>
        <li><strong>Binaural 3D Audio:</strong> Immersive spatial sound recorded on-site to recreate authentic ambient soundscapes.</li>
        <li><strong>Natural Experience:</strong> Pure walking perspectives without intrusive music commentary, allowing you to experience every destination authentically.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>
        Have questions, location suggestions, or business inquiries? Feel free to reach out to us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-yellow-500 hover:underline">Contact Page</a> or follow our latest releases on our YouTube channel.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>